        "<mark style='background:rgba(255,210,0,0.25);padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;'>National Commissions for SCs, STs, OBCs</mark>: Constitutional bodies established under Articles 338, 338A, and 338B respectively, to safeguard the interests of these communities."
